msgstr "Bevestig na het alle boodskap dele geondertekende deur verstek"

#: rc.cpp:219
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Sign All Message Parts By Default</h1>\n"
"If this option is selected, all parts of a message (i.e. the main message "
"body and all attachments) are signed by default.\n"
"<p>\n"
"This is a default setting, you can still override it for each individual "
"message.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Teken Alle Boodskap Dele Deur Verstek</h1>\n"
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, Alle Dele van 'n Boodskap (i.e. die hoof "
"Boodskap liggaam en Alle aanhegsels) word geondertekende Deur Verstek.\n"
"<p>\n"
"hierdie is 'n Verstek opset, jy kan nogsteeds oorskryf dit vir elke "
"individuele Boodskap.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:220
msgid "Ask &before signing each part"
msgstr "Vra voor getekende elke deel"

#: rc.cpp:221
msgid "Check to be asked for each part whether to sign"
msgstr "Bevestig na wees gevra vir elke deel hetsy na teken"

#: rc.cpp:222
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Ask Before Signing Each Part</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, you will be asked for each part of the message "
"(i.e. the main message body as well as all attachments) individually whether "
"you want the part to be signed.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Vra Voor Getekende Elke Deel</h1>\n"
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is gekose, jy sal wees gevra vir Elke Deel van die "
"boodskap (i.e. die hoof boodskap liggaam as goed as alle aanhegsels) "
"individueel hetsy jy wil hê die Deel na wees geondertekende.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:223
msgid "Don'&t sign messages"
msgstr "Moet nie teken boodskappe"

#: rc.cpp:224
msgid "Check for not signing a message by default"
msgstr "Bevestig vir nie getekende 'n boodskap deur verstek"

#: rc.cpp:225
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Don't Sign Messages</h1>\n"
"If this option is selected, messages are not signed by default.\n"
"<p>\n"
"This is a default setting, you can still override it for each individual "
"setting.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Moet nie Teken Boodskappe</h1>\n"
"As hierdie opsie is gekose, Boodskappe word nie geondertekende deur "
"verstek.\n"
"<p>\n"
"hierdie is 'n verstek opset, jy kan nogsteeds oorskryf dit vir elke "
"individuele opset.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:226
msgid "The signature certificate is configured on the <em>Certificates</em> page!"
msgstr ""
"Die handtekening sertifikaat is gekonfigureer op Die <em>Sertifikate</em> "
"bladsy!"

#: rc.cpp:227
msgid "RSA + SHA-1"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:228
msgid "Selects the signature algorithm"
msgstr "Kies die handtekening algeritme"

#: rc.cpp:229
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Signature Algorithm</h1>\n"
"An algorithm is a description for the computer on how it should perform a "
"certain task. The signature algorithm describes how the computer applies "
"your signature key to your message so that the receiver can determine "
"whether the message really is from you.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The selection of a certain signature algorithm determines how easy or how "
"difficult it is to forge a message. However, all algorithms provided in the "
"SPHINX environment are considered to be very safe. Generally, the default "
"will work just fine here.\n"
"<p>\n"
"This setting is a default, you can override it for each individual message.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:230
msgid "Signature &algorithm:"
msgstr "Handtekening algeritme:"

#: rc.cpp:231
msgid "&Store messages with signatures"
msgstr "Stoor boodskappe met handtekeninge"

#: rc.cpp:232
msgid "Check to store messages with their signatures"
msgstr "Bevestig na stoor boodskappe met hulle handtekeninge"

#: rc.cpp:233
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Store Messages With Signatures</h1>\n"
"When this box is checked, sent messages are stored together with the "
"signatures applied to them. This is recommended, because it enables you to "
"check later whether you signed a message or a certain part of it.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Stoor Boodskappe Met Handtekeninge</h1>\n"
"Wanneer hierdie boks is nagegaan, gestuur Boodskappe word gestoor tesame Met "
"die Handtekeninge aangewend na hulle. hierdie is aanbeveel, omdat dit "
"aktiveer jy na bevestig later hetsy jy geondertekende 'n boodskap van 'n "
"sekere deel van dit.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:235
msgid "Standa&rd MIME"
msgstr "Standaard Mime"

#: rc.cpp:236
msgid "A Multipart/Signed holding Signature and signed data."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:237
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Multipart detached signature</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the signature and the signed data will be "
"separate parts of a Multipart/Signed message part. Signed message data will "
"be readable even by Mail User Agents not supporting the signaturing "
"algorithm and not supporting ASN.1 decoding.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:238
msgid "Opa&que (only recommended for SPHINX)"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:239
msgid "Signature and signed data encoded in one ASN.1 block."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:240
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Opaque signed messages</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, both the signature and the signed data will be "
"encoded into one ASN.1 block. Messages will be readable only by Mail User "
"Agents supporting ASN.1 decoding.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

