#: tips.cpp:14
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can get rid of the &quot;[mailing list name]&quot;\n"
"added to the subject of some mailing lists by using the <em>rewrite\n"
"header</em> filter action? Just use\n"
"<pre>rewrite header &quot;Subject&quot;\n"
